   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hand hygiene is an effective and affordable way to prevent the spread of COVID-19 and other diseases. Recently, World Health Organization (WHO) helped children at United Nations Relief and Works Agency (UNRWA) schools in Gaza understand this important lesson so they can protect themselves and others from getting sick by keeping their hands clean.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
